PROVISIONAL (Nov 28, 2026): this commit added the comparator layout. The user
has not yet read Spec.lean line by line, so it records "the audited files as
of this commit", not "files a human approved". When the user has read them,
the user (not Claude) writes the hash of the commit they read here.

The first line is the commit whose audited files (the list at the top of
audit.sh) a human read and approved. audit.sh fails if any of them differ
from that commit. Only the user updates this file, after reading the changed
files; that update is the (re-)audit.
